{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n為迎接TVB 60周年台慶，TVB宣布將推出全新演技競賽真人騷《藝員訓練班》，更震撼邀請到影帝級人馬曾志偉擔任主考官！節目將打破經典，把傳統的藝員訓練班直接搬上舞台，結合經典影視IP進行演技比拼，實行廣邀天下實力之士同台鬥戲，究竟在曾志偉的嚴格把關下，誰能脫穎而出？\n</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/22_8746452706b01190a5f909.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/22_8746452706b01190a5f909.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>TVB慶祝60周年台慶 藝訓班搬上舞台鬥戲</h2>\n<p>為迎接來年香港特別行政區成立30周年及TVB 60周年的大日子，TVB推出連串特備節目，當中重頭戲絕對是全新節目《藝員訓練班》。有別於以往的閉門式訓練，新一代《藝員訓練班》將結合TVB經典影視IP及演技競賽真人騷元素，將整個訓練過程搬上舞台。節目旨在打破經典，廣邀各路實力之士，透過在舞台上公開鬥戲，發掘新一代具潛質的演員。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/21_3928178616b0119044a04f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/21_3928178616b0119044a04f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>影帝級曾志偉任主考官 份量十足引爆期待</h2>\n<p>這次《藝員訓練班》的最大亮點，無疑是主考官的超強份量。節目組成功邀請到影帝級人馬曾志偉坐鎮，擔任節目主考官。作為演藝界舉足輕重的前輩，曾志偉的加盟無疑為節目增添了極大的權威性與說服力。由他親自考核及指導，勢必能為參賽者帶來最專業的意見，同時也讓觀眾對節目的質素充滿信心，消息一出即引爆全城期待。</p>\n<h2>網民反應兩極：終於有心搞返好啲劇！</h2>\n<p>曾志偉坐鎮《藝員訓練班》的消息曝光後，網民反應熱烈。大批網民表示支持和期待：「有曾志偉做評判，今次應該係堅料，唔會玩玩下！」、「TVB終於肯搞返好個藝員訓練班！希望可以見到啲有演技嘅新人出嚟！」、「呢個形式好吸引，好想睇佢哋點樣翻拍經典！」但亦有部分網民抱持觀望態度：「又係真人騷？最驚變咗造馬騷，內定晒啲人選。」、「希望唔好淨係識得翻炒舊IP，要有啲新意。」</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/19_11791574706b0118f76ba8f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/19_11791574706b0118f76ba8f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20_21039320276b0118fc3045e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20_21039320276b0118fc3045e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T13:43:52.465024+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":943,"images":4,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T13:25:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T15:17:28.355808+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T13:37:25.186259+00:00","content_hash":"e21475a7c1752ea2b637f6fa708bdaf5f32a0651c48bb24c3ff57aea20af84c2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}